WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
It's indeed dangerous

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,640
But it’s not impossible

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,480
Is this how it goes? I’ll go

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,400
you are crazy

5
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,680
Just go on like this

6
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,040
We are fully equipped here

7
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:10,200
You definitely need professional equipment.

8
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,120
Can you catch it if you keep going like this?

9
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,240
Go down and get this drill bit

10
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:14,720
Talk for at least half an hour

11
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,600
Can you hold your breath down there for half an hour?

12
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,000
Boy, can you do it?

13
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,080
No problem, no problem, don't worry

14
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:22,120
My Mercury is very good

15
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:28,050
Equip

16
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:29,250
After you find that thing

17
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:30,290
Just be blind first

18
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:31,250
send us signal

19
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:34,260
We'll pull you up. Remember, don't worry.

20
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:37,950
Do as we say

21
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:40,610
Are you ready?

22
00:00:40,610 --> 00:00:41,850
You can go down then

23
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:47,500
Silly brother, he even risked his life for the sake of his future.

24
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:52,260
How many minutes has it been?

25
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:53,420
Twenty-five minutes
